    ["Transferability", "Applicability to other contexts", "Full description of the architecture, tool versions and procedure; resource counts and component inventory reported"],
    ["Dependability", "Consistency of the process", "Repository history retained in full; coding decisions recorded in a codebook (Appendix G)"],
    ["Confirmability", "Findings shaped by the data rather than researcher preference", "Verbatim commit messages and code comments quoted for every theme; the researcher's expectations recorded and checked against disconfirming entries"],
